cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software to record or analyse data that appear in a publication, please cite it using these metadata (cite the version you used)."
type: software
title: "Fermentation Manager 2 (FM2)"
abstract: >-
  Monitoring, control and analysis of lab-scale batch fermentations run on Applikon
  ez2-Control bioreactor controllers: automatic data recording, manual measurements,
  alerts, remote setpoint changes with read-back, growth-curve fits, base-dosing
  metrics and statistics for groups of replicates.
authors:
  - family-names: Isotti
    given-names: Michele
    # orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"   # TODO: fill in (not yet in the repository)
